WEBVTT

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:57.330
- You can't park in the theater. - I am the son of the businessman, Don Enrique.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.000
- The son? - It's my father.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.390
- My father. - Mr. Enrique?

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.410
- Your father. - Mr. Enrique is in the stage.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.110
- There's a general rehearsal. - Oh, thank you.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.470
- Good. - The son?

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:08.720
Oh, he must be the one who studied for medical school.

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.040
It's the first time I see him in 20 years.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.820
The moment is terribly bad!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.810
That damn joy, smile!

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.310
That this is a show to do well the digestion,

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.310
not for the public to decompose.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.810
- An aspirin. - There are already eight aspirins today, sir.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.510
I do not have it to take me to the account of the analgesics I take.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.160
Mr. Mendoza, that abuse is going to hurt you.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.080
Your medical son assures you.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.090
- Julito! - Did you give up?

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.000
The last subject.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.000
- My son is a doctor. - My son, Julio?

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.000
I was forbidden to step on the stage while he was studying.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.000
I was afraid to swallow the atmosphere.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.000
- That's why I'm here today. - There's no danger anymore.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Look, doctor, taking advantage of your presence,

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.000
- my arm hurts a lot. - What are you saying, man?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.990
On a day like this, no one can be sick.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:17.050
- Will you debut the same, Mr. Enrique? - You can't fail in any way.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.050
- Everything is very good. - Don't say it in your diary, but we will debut the same.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.880
- Good luck. - See you later.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.880
- Attention, attention! - Silence!

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.900
We will finish the rehearsal.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.900
We will debut tonight. There are no more locations.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.750
I'll do my best to get this magazine out of the way.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:37.460
I want it to be the most important one I've made in my 30 years of work.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.300
I know it'll take three or four more days of rehearsals,

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.960
but we have to debut.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:46.340
Thank you very much, and good luck.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.790
That kid next to Mr. Enrique!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.790
See how he hugged him? He must be from the family.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.190
He has no family. If he were from the family, he'd hit him.

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.820
- Mom, did you ask him about the transplant? - Of course, honey.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:59.700
You've never worked in a theater. How are you going to know?

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.480
Of course, I've never seen so much disorder.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.980
Let's go.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:07.010
Tell me, why, if everything is so late, they don't suspend the function?

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.010
Oh, no, no, it can be suspended.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.010
But why?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.010
I don't know.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:15.010
It's been 20 years since I joined the company, and the only thing I know is that the function cannot be suspended.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.010
They don't want to talk.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:20.890
These heavy girls.

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.600
What's the matter?

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.590
What new question do they have to ask me?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.650
They've already cut me off today 34 times.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.990
I'm not going anywhere.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.780
I've been here four times for different and stupid reasons.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.780
You know, sir, my daughter has never worked in the theater.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.780
That's why she asks.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:40.780
Tell her, mom, we'll fix it.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:45.940
And if they're going to fix it, what the hell are you going to do to me?

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:50.900
Miss, technicians, let's see if you have a little care that you're going to kill Arge.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:52.900
And today it is forbidden to die in this theater.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.900
Why did you treat the girl like that?

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.790
You know about medicine, doctor, about theater, magazines, nothing.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.000
They are all the daughters of the devil.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.250
If you treat them badly, you're a dog, but they'll listen to you.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.130
It's 40 against 1.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:09.300
- - Bruno, what have they done to me?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.300
- You fainted. - Call the doctor.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.300
- Yes, right away. - Where are you going?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.300
- To look for a doctor. - Who am I? Take her to a chameleon.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.300
- Oh, my God, I'm scared. - Don't be afraid.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.300
Trico, please, take Angelita's clothes.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.170
For the substitute.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.170
Oh, you know.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.450
Don't forget that the most important thing in the magazine is tango.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.450
Don't forget that the most important thing in the magazine is tango.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.090
- Yes. - Don't forget that the most important thing in the magazine is tango.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:34.640
You don't have to rush me. If the audience asks, I'll sing one, two, three, six tangos.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.530
The last one is going to be "Goodbye, Boys".

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.870
Yes, of course. In any case, we'll give you the keys to the theater.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:48.950
When you sing "Goodbye, Boys", close the door, close the light and go, eh?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.440
I'm not interested in the poster. What is imposed is the quality.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.240
- You're right, Clara. - Bye, Baruja.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.220
- Bye, beautiful. Listen to me. - Huh?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:00.000
When I go out, don't go as usual, clap your hands.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.920
Turn around so they don't clap anymore, hm?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.180
That's when they're going to clap.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:10.960
No, don't touch the stage!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:15.800
No! Yes! No!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:16.980
Don't touch the stage!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.590
I'll do it like this.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.640
So, the indebted lady says,

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.500
"Hey, hey, don't shout, hey, hey!"

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.360
"There's no one to dance, there's no one to dance!"

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.180
And the gentleman says, "Why, ma'am, there's no one to dance here,

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.220
but because there's one here who plays!"

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.020
You're not going to be like that in the government, pervert!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.540
It's funny, it's not funny, please.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.160
Tell me something, did you study or didn't you study?

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.280
No, this is not study, this comes out like this, directly.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.940
Or directly, and then the trouble comes.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.960
- What trouble? - What are you doing? What did you tell me?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.980
Hello, yes, it's cold up there.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.180
- To put the fruits, right? - Come on, dear, come on, come on.

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:50.290
Come on, you know that I protect the national industry too.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.750
Listen to me, you won't come looking for your mother today, right?

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.410
You will, eh? A little...

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.610
- Yes, but you are like mothers. - No, no, I won't take you there, eh?

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.000
- We'll go out to dinner. - What?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.800
- We're studying, sir. - Yes, well, guys...

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.490
- Guys, have you studied the script? - Yes.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.390
- Do you know it well? - We know everything.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:12.290
Well, for whatever you want, guys, I wrote this for you with all my heart, with all my love.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.490
- Yes. - But don't add a word, a syllable, not a single word.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.090
- Calm down, sir, calm down. - Wait for him.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.810
Oh, well, when he comes, I want to talk to him, huh? And you in the marineros, behave well, huh?

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.520
- No, no, no, I'm not in the marineros. - Oh, well, you in the bed...

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.920
- No, no, no, sorry, in the bed, sir. - Well, guys, for whatever you want.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.000
- Because you look so good. - Come on, put on some makeup.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.260
Stay calm, we're studying, right?

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.780
- Phenomenal, fantastic. - Very good.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.370
Excuse me, bad news.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.310
- What's up? - Maruja doesn't like the program.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.530
Change the program.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.650
I don't like that guy either.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.070
No, no, you got it wrong, Mr. Enrique.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:52.010
He doesn't like the letters on the program or the newspaper notice.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.310
He says they're too small.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.430
But who do you think it is, the Pampanini?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.660
I don't like it.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.520
No one is indispensable here, not even me.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.000
You know it, write it down.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.600
Take note. If I die...

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.560
Go on, go on. If I die before we debut or during the performance...

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.680
...my corpse will be hidden until Monday.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.460
We can't miss the performances on Friday, Saturday and Sunday.

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.640
On Monday, it doesn't matter. Why rest?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.190
- That's all. - Dad, they won't be able to debut.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:19.110
Angelita hit herself in the head and she won't be able to work.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.350
- Who is Angelita? - A girl from the choir.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.130
Look, Julito, take care of something else.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.390
- That girl you don't even know wants to... - Today she's debuting in the theater...

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.320
...that's why she doesn't know her. She never worked.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.000
Good that they intern her or take her away...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.650
I'm going to talk to Maruja. Come with me.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.650
In the premieres we are always like this.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.650
In the last premiere, 25 aspirins.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:37.650
This one comes calmer.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:38.650
He has 12.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.630
I have 9.

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:42.630
But if everything goes upside down and everything goes wrong and rehearsals are missing,

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.630
why don't they suspend the function? They prepare better and go ahead.

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:46.630
Oh, no, the function can't be suspended.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.630
But why?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.600
Oh, I don't know.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.450
I've been with your father as a secretary for 25 years.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.450
And in the theater I always hear the same thing.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.450
That the function can't be suspended.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.590
Do you want an aspirin, doctor?

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:00.000
Ladies and gentlemen, to be on the front line,

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:19.180
It will be the same as all the magazines. Old things painted as new.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.060
Oh, please, guys. This premiere is important.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:27.060
This magazine is all my hope. Of course, you'll see things seen, right?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:30.000
But don't forget that it's a magazine.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.640
The title says it all.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.440
It's already starting, eh?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:36.100
Don't forget to say something about the best secretary in the world in the papers, eh?

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.920
Let's go, let's go.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.290
First row.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:47.070
Excuse me, girls.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:47.570
Luis!

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:48.410
You can't do that!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:49.610
No, we're dressed.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.470
Come on, come on, don't worry, cover your eyes.

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:56.720
Girls, you have to work with the will that we have at the El Lleno Theater.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.640
In the first row is a faculty professor.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.400
In a high stage, there are three deputies and two senators.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.110
In a low stage, there is the jeweler Richeri of the street Florida.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:09.510
- Where? - Ah, Bibilias!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.510
What madness!

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:13.990
I'm used to it.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.790
Thirty years that I serve at night in the theaters.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.390
Ah, yes, thirty years!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:19.790
And you don't know why the function cannot be suspended?

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.090
I really don't know, but I've always heard it said:

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:25.690
It must be forbidden, sorry, to smoke in the audience.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.390
- Sorry. - Doctor, the girl has been given another dose.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:29.730
She was going to start.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.440
Get out of my way.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.330
Churro, get out of my way.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.870
- Get out of my way. - Yes, ma'am.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.050
Did you hear him say "churro" and you took your hands off him?

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.360
It's a bit nerve-racking.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:50.240
- He'll beat you up. - No, ma'am, it's nerve-racking.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.320
Miss Angelica, he's fainted.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.970
He won't be able to make the presentation.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.180
But it doesn't matter. Go ahead against any obstacle.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.000
- No. - Dear.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.930
Pepe, I've spoken to the journalists, and tomorrow they'll say you mess with the whole magazine.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:12.480
Look, the journalists are very kind, but to be honest, I'd rather you say it to the public, don't you think?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.480
Oh, Pepito, let's go, yes, Pepito.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.050
Ladies and gentlemen, good evening.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:24.820
First of all, I want to tell you that I am the master of ceremonies, the one who announces the numbers here.

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:29.480
I'm telling you now, so you don't have to be wondering who that idiot will be.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:40.240
but anyway, what a show we have, what a show we have, what a show we have.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:49.320
Well, gentlemen, anyway, we have reached the day of the debut, despite all the inconveniences that arose.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:53.880
Coincidentally, yesterday, in the girls' dressing room, there was a beginning of a fire.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:12:00.000
The firefighters came, but thankfully everything was fixed in three hours, half an hour to put out the fire,

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:04.510
two and a half hours to get the firefighters out of the dressing rooms and now we start our

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:08.000
show with the great presentation

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.550
- They'll be in the next painting. - Don't worry.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:55.390
- Which painting? - The Chinese painting for the girl.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:14:00.000
- What's the matter? - I lost the magazine's book and now it's gone.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.160
the painting you wrote.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.160
That they improvise anything. It will be more funny.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:09.400
Friends, I love that you like the show

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.100
and you still haven't seen anything.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:17.350
When the show ends, then yes, you will not have seen anything.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:20.460
And now I want to tell you something intimate.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:24.930
They just told me in the dressing room that I have become a father of a family.

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:30.000
I am anxious to see the face that my lady will put when she knows it.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:40.150
And now, continuing with the show, we present to you two stars of cinema, theater, radio, television, and the Investigation Commission.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.870
Yes, let the lady pass.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:45.920
Ah, sir, the three trucks have arrived.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:49.040
Good, load up Borlenga's depots and take them away.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:54.660
- Good. - Yes, Investigation Commission.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.520
No, no, sir. You don't accept recommendations or false testimonies.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:04.030
- Look, sir, I'm innocent. - Ma'am, not me.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:08.450
Look, sir, I'm innocent.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.450
Everything I have, I inherited. And what I didn't inherit, I saved.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.450
- If you don't believe me, you can ask. - Ma'am, for your peace of mind...

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.310
...I have to tell you that you haven't been invited.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.310
- Don't forget to introduce yourself. - That's right, of course.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.310
But what they say in the neighborhood...

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.310
...and the trumpets they throw at me when I go out on the street...

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.310
...and one is a young lady and she doesn't want me to...

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.310
- Young lady of what? Young lady of what? - Oh, I'm sorry, sir.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.830
Excuse me, the lexicon.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.060
Are you sorry, ma'am or ma'am?

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:33.640
Well, why should I cut myself short?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:37.010
I'm not a ma'am, but I'm not a ma'am either.

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:37.930
I don't get it.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.860
I want to tell you that as a ma'am, I'm a liar.

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:44.630
And as a ma'am, I'm a fraud.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.190
Could you tell me what you did in '43?

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:50.690
In '43? I think I went to school in sixth grade.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:53.100
No, no, in '43, I asked you.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.700
Oh, I thought you were talking to me about a three years ago.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.190
No, no, about a three years back.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.680
In '43.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:03.470
- May I tell the truth, sir? - The absolute truth.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:06.870
All right. Look, here's what I'm going to give you.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.970
- In '43, I was a telephonist. - Did you earn?

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.970
I earned 250 pesos a month.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.810
Today, the account of your bank accuses 2 million pesos in cash.

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:16.490
A saving woman like me is not going to find another, sir.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.670
Your patrimony also has a couple of rooms in Venado Tuerto.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:22.550
Take it for cigarettes. That has nothing to do with it. That's a gift.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:24.750
And I think that receiving gifts is not forbidden.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.320
Women are used to receiving gifts.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:30.000
Like a basket of flowers, candy...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.330
- Caramel. - Oh, my God!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:36.920
What woman hasn't received from her admirer an orchid thrown into her pasture?

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:40.380
Yes, but you've thrown it with two stances, with cows and horses.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.580
You've filled it with dirt and you haven't noticed.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.080
Oh, there are two stances, two chacritas.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:48.630
In the information we have, it appears that you were, how shall we say...

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.190
...a direct friend of an order from Iati.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.340
- How did you find out? - After a secretary of the ministry.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.880
Later, a deputy, after a senator...

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:00.000
...and finally, a much more influential character.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:08.320
Well, sir, I think everyone has the right to progress, I wasn't going to keep the order all my life, don't you think so?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:11.600
In jewels, what value does it have?

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.600
In jewels of what do you say, of halakha?

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.550
Yes, of halakha.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:23.550
Well, look, the truth is a few cans, about 7 kilos of gold, a few bright ones, a few emeralds, but I reiterate what I said, sir, they are won with the sweat of ...

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:29.920
Well, with sweat, with sweat and with tears.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.440
Don't believe me, sir, I've cried a lot. There are things that hurt in this life.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.960
Well, miss, we've concluded.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.780
I'm sorry to inform you that you won't be able to use it until you thoroughly investigate...

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.340
...the clothes, the money, and the dresses.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.320
As for the rooms, those are under our custody.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:48.270
Oh, nice! So now you're going to come and take care of the room?

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.970
I'll take care of the room by myself.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.050
Then you want to make it clear that there's freedom.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.130
If in the end we're worse than before.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:57.590
Well, miss, do whatever you want. We'll do what we have to do.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:58.680
You may withdraw.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.220
All right, I'll retire.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:08.720
If a woman in love has to walk like this...

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:15.950
Tell me, are you sure you want me to retire?

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.550
After all, I'm not so, so, so ugly.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:22.280
And you're young, handsome, nice.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:25.850
And what is life without a pure run to death?

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.590
Yes, in total we will live three or four minutes.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:29.800
I don't know what you mean.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.650
Really? Tell me, don't you like her as a woman?

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:38.840
Of course not, she's an interesting woman, a good girl.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.240
I knew I was going to catch him on that side.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:49.280
Tell me, good man, at what time do you finish your job as an officer?

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.310
Within an hour, more or less.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:55.580
- Do you like whiskey? - If it's foreign, yes.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:00.000
I suppose my file will be in Chimalco.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.300
Oh, no, no, no. One thing is the duty.

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.900
If I like you as a man, you're interested in me as a woman.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.200
But otherwise, as guilty as before.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:10.400
Oh, how funny! But what did you want? The Chagratarola party?

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.000
- What? - Of course.

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:14.790
Besides, I'm leaving. I'm not used to being treated like this.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.210
You know, with two times they kick me out, I already know what I have to do.

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:20.110
So then, I'm leaving, you know? I'm leaving.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:23.070
- Has he left? - No, not yet.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.430
- What does he want? - The truth.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:28.310
- Look, the truth, I want to ask you something. - Ask.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:30.000
Tell me, that interesting character...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.340
- Where is he? - In La Cera.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.060
- And the senator? - In Caseros.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:38.960
- And the deputy and the secretary? - In the police department.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.200
Grateful, they left me alone.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.320
And the ordinance, what is the ordinance?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.810
- That one is for voting. - Poor thing.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:50.290
That was the first one. And you?

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.660
I'm here for now.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:55.070
- Tomorrow, who knows? - Why?

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:59.310
- So many things can happen. - Just in case.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.540
I have reserved a ticket to Montevideo.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.940
Lelia, we can't get to the painting.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.240
Here are the clothes.

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:08.120
I have a girl to try on. Come on, Paquita.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.240
No, a thinner one.

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:11.060
There's nothing else in the dressing room.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.820
- Come on, you black girl. - Lelia.

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.100
The girl lost her chin.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.600
- What do we do? - But this girl is having a hard time.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:18.440
Take the painting.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.980
- I'm going to paint the chin. - Hurry up, please.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.560
I don't have four hands.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.980
You should have agreed before.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.870
How do you want me to see it before it breaks?

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.190
We can't get there. I have a headache.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.000
- The painting has started. - Hey!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:34.590
Leave it alone! At least you're okay for tomorrow.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:21:00.000
- Please. - So I'm naked.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.800
- Sir! - That is, undress for the painting without clothes.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:08.400
My daughter doesn't make that number. I already told Mr. Enrique and if they force us, I won't work on any painting.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.700
Ma'am, that's the only thing you've done so far.

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.480
Get ready for the afro then.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:16.520
- And good luck and may nothing happen to you. - Thank you. Bye.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:38.960
The last carnivals, I was in Mar del Plata.

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:42.490
Of course, I can't pay the prices that the hotels ask for out there,

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:46.090
but walking, walking, I found a pretty cheap hotel.

00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:48.280
10 pesos per day.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:51.860
I wasn't exactly in the center of Mar del Plata, I was in Dolores.

00:22:52.960 --> 00:22:55.620
But anyway, it's good for me to walk to the beach.

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:57.050
See you later.

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:58.820
Excuse me, Mr. García.

00:22:59.140 --> 00:22:59.730
Ma'am?

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.600
I have a problem that only you can solve for me.

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:03.890
You will tell me, ma'am?

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:07.840
Look, I have a hotel full of people and a lady has just arrived who is a client.

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:11.440
Imagine, at this hour of the night I can't leave her without a room.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:12.850
And what have you thought?

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.450
I have thought of giving her this bed for this night.

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:17.230
She is a lady.

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:19.030
Look, love, if she doesn't have any inconvenience...

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.630
She won't have it, and you know how much I appreciate it.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:23.030
No, it doesn't matter.

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:26.460
In the world we walk and we find complete hotels.

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:29.540
In Mar del Plata we are and in La Ruleta sometimes we stop.

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:30.000
I'm going to see my daughter.

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:39.100
Thank you, Mr. García. And thank you very much, once again.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:42.350
- There were no inconveniences? - No inconveniences, ma'am.

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:48.900
- Good night. - Good night.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:51.660
Mrs. De Pérez, Mr. García.

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.390
- Ma'am? - Yes?

00:23:54.390 --> 00:24:00.000
Mr. García has been kind enough to give you part of your room tonight.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.360
Gracia is a gentleman in all the sense of the word.

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:05.640
Well, she's going to ruminate, isn't she?

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:08.840
For my part, I thank her for her inattention.

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:13.000
A woman alone feels honored to be treated that way.

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:15.230
Evidently, her way of being...

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:18.380
...rehabilitates a sex a little...

00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:21.650
...as I would say, lack of scruples.

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:24.220
I'm glad you agreed so soon.

00:24:24.300 --> 00:24:29.310
- Excuse me. - Good evening.

00:24:30.920 --> 00:24:39.410
Well, you see, you are in your room, just have the player coming out to the right.

00:24:39.410 --> 00:24:41.490
Thank you very much, Mr. García.

00:25:00.250 --> 00:25:02.250
- Ma'am? - If you were so kind.

00:25:02.250 --> 00:25:14.780
- Who? - Thank you very much, Mr. García.

00:25:14.780 --> 00:25:16.130
You're welcome.

00:26:06.040 --> 00:26:09.920
- Mr. García, have a good night. - You too, Mrs. Pérez.

00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:23.680
Thank you. I'm sorry to bother you, but I feel a little hot.

00:26:23.960 --> 00:26:27.520
- Would you be so kind as to open the window for me? - You're welcome.

00:26:27.920 --> 00:26:29.480
It's a pleasure for me, ma'am.

00:26:30.250 --> 00:26:32.200
Yes, that's why we are here.

00:26:32.720 --> 00:26:34.800
We have to get out of here, don't we?

00:26:37.820 --> 00:26:40.040
- Yes, ma'am. - Thank you very much, Mr. García.

00:26:40.080 --> 00:26:41.420
You're welcome, ma'am.

00:26:41.440 --> 00:26:44.840
Anything you want, you know, call me and I'll do it.

00:26:44.860 --> 00:26:48.020
Don't call me.

00:26:48.590 --> 00:26:51.380
- Good night, ma'am. - Good night, Mr. García.

00:27:00.350 --> 00:27:05.440
- Please, Mr. García. Mr. García. - Yes?

00:27:05.600 --> 00:27:08.800
You'll say I'm annoying, but if you were so kind...

00:27:09.040 --> 00:27:12.550
Look, before I thought it was hot, and now I'm feeling cold.

00:27:12.990 --> 00:27:16.270
- Would it be so kind to close the window? - Yes, that's fine.

00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:19.110
I'll put it here.

00:27:39.310 --> 00:27:45.910
- No, Mr. García. - Mr. García.

00:27:46.900 --> 00:27:49.920
Mr. García.

00:27:50.740 --> 00:27:52.660
In the end, I'll be able to bother him.

00:27:52.790 --> 00:27:54.260
But of course, it's that...

00:27:54.410 --> 00:27:56.730
White hands don't sell cold.

00:27:56.980 --> 00:27:59.280
It turns out that I feel hot again.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:03.170
Would you mind opening the window again?

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:33.680
I would like for a few moments to be the Mrs. García.

00:28:33.680 --> 00:28:35.680
The hotel owner told me that you were a gentleman.

00:28:35.680 --> 00:28:39.070
Words carry the wind.

00:28:39.070 --> 00:28:45.770
Think, I would not like to be the Mrs. García.

00:28:45.770 --> 00:28:50.680
Well, since you ask me like that, give me love.

00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:59.980
And then why don't you stop bothering and open the window, you who are already tired of me, huh?

00:29:00.350 --> 00:29:03.170
That's the music I'm going to sing now. Will you give it to the teacher?

00:29:03.820 --> 00:29:05.360
How can I give it to the teacher?

00:29:05.830 --> 00:29:07.510
I'm the master of ceremonies here.

00:29:08.220 --> 00:29:10.360
Well, go, go.

00:29:10.870 --> 00:29:12.670
Go, go, go.

00:29:14.100 --> 00:29:15.710
And now a number of singing.

00:29:16.030 --> 00:29:17.810
Teacher, here is the music.

00:29:19.180 --> 00:29:25.010
I have many years of theater and on the day of the premiere I get as nervous

00:29:25.110 --> 00:29:27.120
as the first of the "partiquinos".

00:29:27.260 --> 00:29:30.000
That's right, the theater should not be suspended.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.780
The theater has to be first of all.

00:29:32.800 --> 00:29:36.080
There it is, I wanted to know why the show can't be suspended.

00:29:36.100 --> 00:29:40.260
Look, I've asked the fashion designer, the fireman, the fireman, and no one knows why.

00:29:40.280 --> 00:29:44.660
Look, you finally asked your dad. Leave me alone, you don't see how I am here.

00:29:44.660 --> 00:29:51.890
♪ Sing no more, ♪

00:29:52.320 --> 00:30:00.000
♪ I'm going to leave you once and for all ♪

00:30:00.030 --> 00:30:06.340
I understand that you need to ask, you cheated on me

00:30:06.340 --> 00:30:12.900
You still love me

00:30:12.900 --> 00:30:17.790
Don't cry, don't tell me that you're sad

00:30:17.790 --> 00:30:21.630
Or that you're still leaving with reason

00:30:21.630 --> 00:30:25.630
Nobody would know if you were a good workwoman

00:30:25.630 --> 00:30:29.270
I don't know if you had a heart

00:30:43.020 --> 00:30:48.690
I'm begging you to go away from my side, my beloved.

00:31:29.210 --> 00:31:30.000
Hey!

00:31:31.760 --> 00:31:43.170
that I look at you more I remember what I was of the life that I spent, that I no longer

00:31:43.170 --> 00:32:00.000
you are no longer my torment and my pain, come on, let's finish as soon as possible with this cross, this anguish and this love.

00:32:01.880 --> 00:32:10.790
I don't care about the past, I ask for compassion

00:32:10.790 --> 00:32:14.090
But if I'm saying that you go away from my side

00:32:14.090 --> 00:32:17.160
God, what a life!

00:32:53.870 --> 00:33:00.000
international all of you know it all of you admire it all of you

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:02.180
With you, Pepe Arias.

00:33:02.180 --> 00:33:12.290
Here where you see me, I was the last one who joined.

00:33:12.290 --> 00:33:14.470
Do you realize?

00:33:14.470 --> 00:33:20.280
Twelve years waiting for the cake to bite the last day.

00:33:20.280 --> 00:33:26.880
I wrote just, just on the 15th of June.

00:33:26.880 --> 00:33:30.000
A day before it fell.

00:33:30.090 --> 00:33:32.730
They were the rumors in the Plaza de Mayo,

00:33:32.990 --> 00:33:35.590
the day that the unconscious chiquilines

00:33:35.890 --> 00:33:38.550
dedicated the bombing to the leader,

00:33:41.070 --> 00:33:43.970
since they had to wait for the last moment to bite.

00:33:44.900 --> 00:33:49.090
These sailors could have passed the saint.

00:33:57.670 --> 00:34:00.000
And we joined hands with a man

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:05.120
He was given a Mercury 55-0 Km.

00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:06.120
They promised it to me.

00:34:06.120 --> 00:34:08.950
They didn't give me time to check.

00:34:08.950 --> 00:34:11.880
The rotten one came the next day.

00:34:11.880 --> 00:34:17.580
And the rumors began.

00:34:17.580 --> 00:34:20.340
That the gorillas are coming.

00:34:20.340 --> 00:34:23.410
That the gorillas are going to come.

00:34:23.410 --> 00:34:28.010
And the gorillas came.

00:34:28.010 --> 00:34:30.000
But in the end I want to say what happened...

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:36.280
I still don't know if we weren't doing well before we weren't fulfilling the second plan

00:34:36.280 --> 00:34:49.680
that in general we lost because we didn't want to tell you the boys when there was freedom because we

00:34:49.680 --> 00:35:00.000
bought the eagle because we don't buy the petit café we made two basic units I was crazy look that crazy

00:35:01.280 --> 00:35:04.460
Of course, after he came from Córdoba he said:

00:35:04.460 --> 00:35:06.240
"But even there the thing came out!"

00:35:06.240 --> 00:35:13.160
Thank God that Córdoba was clean.

00:35:13.160 --> 00:35:19.920
That if we entered Barre, you know how we are, right?

00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:25.120
And the fleet?

00:35:25.120 --> 00:35:29.670
The fleet seems to be not, but...

00:35:31.210 --> 00:35:36.020
- Yes, right? - They are grateful, these sailors.

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.440
They will remember the man.

00:35:39.080 --> 00:35:43.880
Lately it's our fault that they didn't want to take a car.

00:35:44.080 --> 00:35:47.200
What did they want to be given? Tires.

00:35:47.930 --> 00:35:49.670
They will remember the man.

00:35:50.340 --> 00:35:52.710
In the end, we didn't buy the ferrocarriles.

00:35:52.950 --> 00:35:57.180
It's good that they arrived when they wanted to, but they were ours.

00:35:57.340 --> 00:36:00.000
And the telephones, did any guineleiro complain?

00:36:00.120 --> 00:36:03.030
because the device was not working.

00:36:03.030 --> 00:36:05.960
You laugh so that all the people will realize that we raise a judge.

00:36:05.960 --> 00:36:13.360
You will know in 200 years, when I talk about the story of Grosso,

00:36:13.360 --> 00:36:17.360
then I know that they are going to start putting busts.

00:36:17.360 --> 00:36:25.200
And speaking of busts, what a raid of statues!

00:36:25.200 --> 00:36:28.800
What hunger is going to pass Tomasi in Italy!

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:40.010
And speaking of hunger, what about the life of the great Caballa Martínez?

00:36:40.010 --> 00:36:44.320
How did they let him grab that ball?

00:36:44.320 --> 00:36:47.580
Let them finish this, huh?

00:36:47.580 --> 00:36:54.740
Let them finish that you still know, right?

00:36:54.740 --> 00:37:00.000
And this kiss with the Uruguayans...

00:37:01.600 --> 00:37:05.030
How disgusting these Uruguayans are!

00:37:08.290 --> 00:37:12.350
We have been promoting the fight for 12 years

00:37:12.430 --> 00:37:17.090
against these communists, and I say communists because they are orientalists,

00:37:17.190 --> 00:37:19.860
and now it turns out that we are like brothers!

00:37:20.280 --> 00:37:23.920
Come on, let them finish it.

00:37:24.290 --> 00:37:28.260
And they talk about outrageous Uruguayan patriotism.

00:37:28.360 --> 00:37:30.000
Radio Carve! Radio Carve!

00:37:30.540 --> 00:37:33.590
Radio Senadal, Radio de Córdoba.

00:37:33.700 --> 00:37:42.260
What would the Russian Yankelevich say if he came from Grignere?

00:37:42.460 --> 00:37:52.540
Would we hate our enemies?

00:37:52.740 --> 00:37:56.180
No! Absolutely not!

00:37:56.380 --> 00:37:59.540
You know, I...

00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:07.230
The offensive? No, absolutely not.

00:38:07.230 --> 00:38:11.120
Have we ever threatened our enemies?

00:38:11.120 --> 00:38:15.090
No, absolutely not.

00:38:15.090 --> 00:38:20.940
Of course, once the boss went away and spoke from five to one.

00:38:20.940 --> 00:38:23.150
But he said it as a joke.

00:38:23.150 --> 00:38:27.280
Yes, yes, he always laughed.

00:38:30.220 --> 00:38:33.880
Lately, I don't know what he was laughing about.

00:38:34.870 --> 00:38:44.270
He laughed a little at Tirael's fault.

00:38:44.650 --> 00:38:47.990
Because look what he got with the renunciation.

00:38:48.230 --> 00:38:52.820
Renunciation! Renunciation! Renunciation!

00:38:53.390 --> 00:38:55.030
- What? - They grabbed him.

00:38:57.330 --> 00:39:00.000
What a peperina they gave him.

00:39:00.510 --> 00:39:03.880
Yes, and they brought her from Córdoba.

