24 hours with new shoes and two smaller numbers is breaking the record.

01:04:07.540 --> 01:04:11.080
- The actress is very pretty. - Oh, thank you, I'm sure we invited her.

01:04:11.860 --> 01:04:16.760
- I couldn't do it. - My little girl, my little girl.

01:04:18.840 --> 01:04:30.000
To be now in the middle of the moon, poor thing, she's so shy, just like me when my Romualdo...

01:04:30.090 --> 01:04:36.480
He took me on my first wedding night in a horse car.

01:04:36.670 --> 01:04:38.900
How romantic, with horses!

01:04:39.060 --> 01:04:41.720
Sometimes not so much, isn't it?

01:04:41.920 --> 01:04:44.840
Maybe they went to a bar. Do you know that modern people...

01:04:45.040 --> 01:04:50.240
Oh, my daughter, don't be silly, dear, but do you think Irene is an idiot?

01:04:50.390 --> 01:04:55.350
Besides, the girl knows her obligations.

01:04:56.380 --> 01:04:59.160
Oh, no!

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:03.540
- Do you put on your shoes? - No, you don't even remind me of it.

01:05:03.620 --> 01:05:07.770
These shoes are very nice.

01:05:07.850 --> 01:05:09.650
And a little drawer.

01:05:09.730 --> 01:05:12.890
- Do you need me for something else, ma'am? - No, dear, nothing else.

01:05:12.970 --> 01:05:14.760
You have to sleep well.

01:05:14.790 --> 01:05:18.700
- And have fun with your boyfriend. - Oh, I'm in Antarctica. I'm desperate.

01:05:18.780 --> 01:05:21.520
It's going to be so cold. Good night.

01:05:21.600 --> 01:05:25.290
Ma'am!

01:05:25.350 --> 01:05:28.710
Ma'am!

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:36.330
Come here. I'll bring you this package wrapped around your neck.

01:05:36.600 --> 01:05:38.450
Rosita, get out of here.

01:05:38.490 --> 01:05:40.430
Yes, ma'am.

01:05:40.450 --> 01:05:42.770
But, who am I marrying?

01:05:43.380 --> 01:05:44.380
With a Hindu?

01:05:44.980 --> 01:05:46.400
With an untouchable?

01:05:46.560 --> 01:05:48.360
Don't let me get close, ma'am.

01:05:48.750 --> 01:05:49.750
I'll give it back to you.

01:05:49.990 --> 01:05:53.430
I want you to give me back the 15 pesos from the marriage certificate.

01:05:53.750 --> 01:05:55.150
Don't even touch it, ma'am.

01:05:55.400 --> 01:05:58.320
Don't even touch it. It's 0 kilometers, ma'am. Don't even touch it.

01:05:58.340 --> 01:05:59.510
But, baby...

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:06.170
- What did you do to Ireneo? - Nothing, she didn't do anything to me, that's why I'm protesting, because she didn't do anything to me.

01:06:06.170 --> 01:06:10.270
She didn't teach you anything, everything you had to do.

01:06:10.270 --> 01:06:13.010
That's the same as giving a fish a bath, ma'am.

01:06:13.010 --> 01:06:18.750
I quit being in the dark, she turned off the light.

01:06:18.750 --> 01:06:22.100
- Brutal. - Where did you learn that?

01:06:22.100 --> 01:06:30.000
When we were in the car, I wanted to caress her, as much as to prepare the terrain, as to prepare the romance, one has his

01:06:30.060 --> 01:06:32.680
I'll show you your taxi experience.

01:06:32.720 --> 01:06:35.940
I saw a little bite that almost took my little finger out, ma'am.

01:06:35.960 --> 01:06:38.310
You bit him, baby?

01:06:38.420 --> 01:06:40.820
He said it was an inconvenience in the least.

01:06:40.860 --> 01:06:43.960
Ireneo, where did you educate yourself?

01:06:43.960 --> 01:06:51.640
I told him, "Mommy, you'll see in a while how cute Papito is."

01:06:51.680 --> 01:06:54.730
That phrase is an inconvenience for minors.

01:06:54.740 --> 01:06:57.480
But he's not my Papito, he's a bad boy.

01:06:57.580 --> 01:06:59.760
And he's not as ugly as my dad was.

01:07:00.540 --> 01:07:05.060
But what do you think, my daughter? I got married to talk with him.

01:07:05.060 --> 01:07:12.950
When we arrived at the hotel, I had to get up to get to the room.

01:07:12.950 --> 01:07:16.520
That's how you do it in the big movies.

01:07:16.520 --> 01:07:20.130
Dad didn't do it with me when he got married.

01:07:20.130 --> 01:07:23.130
Yes, yes, yes, no, don't tell me, ma'am, I can imagine.

01:07:23.130 --> 01:07:25.130
Your husband wasn't a faggot.

01:07:25.130 --> 01:07:27.990
Irene, he wasn't for that.

01:07:27.990 --> 01:07:30.000
Forgive me, ma'am.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:34.000
You know what he did to me? He gave me a slap in front of all the cops!

01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:38.800
He took me from here to get me up, and he did as in all the collectives.

01:07:38.800 --> 01:07:43.640
Lie! I want a divorce, ma'am!

01:07:43.640 --> 01:07:48.970
You can do this to Irineo Mendoza, doctor and delegate of the Abivado syndicate.

01:07:48.970 --> 01:07:52.970
Just a moment, just a moment, just a moment. Everything is in order.

01:07:52.970 --> 01:07:55.730
We'll talk about it later.

01:07:55.730 --> 01:07:58.910
Take off your coat, baby.

01:08:05.470 --> 01:08:08.870
- My mother. - Oimele Guizán.

01:08:08.940 --> 01:08:12.960
- Irineo, ma'am, Irineo. - And you were going to lose all that?

01:08:13.200 --> 01:08:16.900
Pure glass. There's nothing inside. It's empty.

01:08:16.980 --> 01:08:21.390
- It's a mess. - Yes, because I met her in front of a jewelry store.

01:08:21.470 --> 01:08:24.590
One moment, one moment. Come on, baby, go inside.

01:08:24.670 --> 01:08:28.070
- I'm going to talk to your husband. - But I don't want to go with him.

01:08:28.120 --> 01:08:30.000
You go with him, mom.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:35.400
Excuse me, but don't you see, ma'am, that she is an unconscious, that she is a degenerate, that girl?

01:08:35.400 --> 01:08:37.400
Don't you see that now she wants to go with the luggage?

01:08:37.400 --> 01:08:38.600
Hey, Deneo!

01:08:38.600 --> 01:08:43.200
Yes, yes, yes, yes, excuse me, ma'am, I don't know what I'm saying, I'm all trolled, excuse me.

01:08:43.200 --> 01:08:47.500
Don't spend the night forgiving, for now let's talk calmly, let's talk calmly.

01:08:47.500 --> 01:08:51.000
Think that the girl, it's the first time.

01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:53.200
It would be good if it wasn't the first time.

01:08:53.200 --> 01:08:56.770
She's innocent, she's as pure as me.

01:08:56.770 --> 01:08:57.520
What?

01:08:57.520 --> 01:08:58.210
She was.

01:08:58.210 --> 01:08:59.830
Yes, time has passed.

01:09:00.120 --> 01:09:02.120
Look, ma'am, please, let's talk seriously.

01:09:02.120 --> 01:09:04.120
I'm in a hurry.

01:09:04.120 --> 01:09:06.120
You missed class.

01:09:06.120 --> 01:09:11.140
When you saw your reaction, you should have waited two days, a week, a month.

01:09:11.140 --> 01:09:13.140
But ma'am, why do you want me to wait?

01:09:13.140 --> 01:09:16.140
I have my temperament, why do you want me to laugh?

01:09:16.140 --> 01:09:19.140
But I don't need you to come to me from the maneuvers.

01:09:20.220 --> 01:09:23.860
You should congratulate her for her modesty.

01:09:23.860 --> 01:09:25.950
Congratulate her, instead of criticizing her.

01:09:25.950 --> 01:09:28.000
But ma'am, this is over.

01:09:28.000 --> 01:09:30.000
I'll go tomorrow.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:31.960
and I'm going to my mother's house and that's it.

01:09:31.960 --> 01:09:33.760
Don't be hasty.

01:09:33.760 --> 01:09:38.040
Don't be hasty, I'm sure the girl is already upset.

01:09:38.040 --> 01:09:43.470
Girl! Girl!

01:09:43.470 --> 01:09:45.610
I've already prepared myself to go to bed.

01:09:45.610 --> 01:09:48.610
My mother!

01:09:48.610 --> 01:09:52.610
This is the same as giving bicarbonate to a starving dead.

01:09:52.610 --> 01:09:55.030
God, she's upset.

01:09:55.030 --> 01:09:58.040
No, mom, let him go to his house.

01:09:58.040 --> 01:10:00.000
I'll stay with you and my father.

01:10:00.030 --> 01:10:02.830
But don't you see that her daughter is degenerate, ma'am?

01:10:02.830 --> 01:10:06.130
Don't you see that she marries me and then wants to go to war with her cousin?

01:10:06.130 --> 01:10:11.670
But dear, you married this great man since today, your husband,

01:10:11.670 --> 01:10:17.070
who will love you, who will pamper you, who will do you all the pleasures.

01:10:17.070 --> 01:10:20.870
But of course, on Sunday we can go to Palermo,

01:10:20.870 --> 01:10:26.980
we go to the boats, the next day we go to the zoo to see the monkey eating the carrots.

01:10:26.980 --> 01:10:30.000
Ah, but what about tonight?

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:36.400
- What about tonight? - Tonight, I'll tell you a story about thieves until you fall asleep.

01:10:36.500 --> 01:10:42.220
Well, but to sleep, huh? If you wake up, I'll call my mommy. Do you hear?

01:10:42.320 --> 01:10:47.080
I swear I won't wake up. I swear it for our children.

01:10:47.180 --> 01:10:52.940
- But if we don't have babies? - Yes. And the more we go, we won't even have it on television.

01:10:53.040 --> 01:10:56.690
- Come on, girl, come on. - Let's go, son.

01:10:56.820 --> 01:11:00.000
- Wait, don't you see that it's her? - I don't understand.

01:11:03.040 --> 01:11:05.100
Tonight you'll stay at home.

01:11:05.720 --> 01:11:07.830
Take it, Irineo.

01:11:08.820 --> 01:11:10.820
And don't forget the biblical precept.

01:11:12.250 --> 01:11:14.390
Grow and multiply.

01:11:15.390 --> 01:11:19.200
He prepared me well.

01:11:20.200 --> 01:11:22.200
Stay still with your hands, Irineo.

01:11:22.200 --> 01:11:24.200
But baby, don't make me hate you, please.

01:11:24.200 --> 01:11:27.080
Calm down, son, calm down.

01:11:28.080 --> 01:11:29.670
He prepared me well.

01:11:30.030 --> 01:11:31.570
Nina, don't go, Nina.

01:11:31.570 --> 01:11:33.330
Take her in your arms.

01:11:33.330 --> 01:11:35.330
Me too, Eva.

01:11:36.540 --> 01:11:40.260
I'll stay here to watch over your dreams.

01:11:40.260 --> 01:11:40.950
Go.

01:11:40.950 --> 01:11:44.470
Don't make a mother for her children.

01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:40.810
- Where are you going? - I'm going to see Estabile.

01:12:42.180 --> 01:12:43.780
Borrello failed me!

01:12:46.660 --> 01:12:49.560
Don't forget, prepare the lady, the joke I told you is about to start.

01:12:51.440 --> 01:12:53.160
Oh, my God, what am I going to do?

01:12:53.480 --> 01:12:54.870
I forgot to bring the lady.

01:13:04.570 --> 01:13:06.910
- Get out of here, ma'am. - Me? Get out of here, you son of a bitch!

01:13:06.910 --> 01:13:08.910
- Yes, you get out of here, please. - No, I said get out of here.

01:13:08.910 --> 01:13:13.760
- Get out of here, ma'am. - God sent you, ma'am.

01:13:13.760 --> 01:13:19.630
- No, he pushed me. - Look, ma'am, could you please help me?

01:13:19.630 --> 01:13:21.110
- I'm a poor man. - Yes.

01:13:21.110 --> 01:13:24.940
- Tell me what's wrong with me. - Read, you are this.

01:13:24.940 --> 01:13:30.000
Your lady had trillizos. Urgent money.

01:13:31.020 --> 01:13:33.880
- What do I have to do with this? - Can't you give me some money?

01:13:33.950 --> 01:13:37.030
- What? - Plates.

01:13:37.130 --> 01:13:39.710
- I don't know how to wash plates. - Then go and wash floors.

01:13:39.780 --> 01:13:43.320
- I don't know how to wash floors either. - Tell me, what do you know how to do?

01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:45.240
And didn't you give him the telegram?

01:14:00.440 --> 01:14:03.230
It's going to the end!

01:14:03.230 --> 01:14:06.150
It's a predestined one.

01:14:44.140 --> 01:14:46.960
- Wonderful, wonderful, wonderful. - Thank you, thank you, how kind, how kind.

01:14:46.960 --> 01:14:48.920
- Look, look, they're very good. - Yes?

01:14:48.920 --> 01:14:50.920
- Two cigars cost 50 pesos. - Wow.

01:14:50.920 --> 01:14:53.000
- Yes, thank you. - Thank you very much, how kind.

01:14:53.000 --> 01:14:54.000
- You're welcome, you're welcome.

01:14:54.000 --> 01:14:56.820
- Two cigars, 50 pesos.

01:15:02.110 --> 01:15:04.320
He stayed with the one that costs 48.

01:15:47.400 --> 01:15:50.740
Dear, it's fate. You were born for a doctor. Do you like it?

01:15:50.780 --> 01:16:00.000
Oh, you don't know how to inject, you son of a bitch.

01:16:00.090 --> 01:16:03.080
- What a debut! - I've been working at the magazine for 10 years...

01:16:03.080 --> 01:16:05.080
...and the only one that came to me was "Chocolatinero".

01:16:05.080 --> 01:16:08.080
- Did you read it? - Yes, I'm very greedy.

01:16:08.080 --> 01:16:14.560
- Come on, you can see certain things. - I'm a doctor.

01:16:14.560 --> 01:16:17.560
- You're a child specialist. - I'm a girl.

01:16:17.560 --> 01:16:21.560
- Come on, get ready, come on. - Come on, come on, it suits me to see certain things.

01:16:21.560 --> 01:16:27.880
- Mrs. Manuela, today they were going to hire you, it was great. - Really?

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:03.160
I'll introduce you to my future wife, and to your mother.

01:17:03.160 --> 01:17:04.390
I'm getting married.

01:17:04.390 --> 01:17:07.780
Man, you're asking for it in a way. Congratulations.

01:17:33.040 --> 01:17:34.960
Ah, I thought I caught you.

01:17:34.960 --> 01:17:36.920
You laughed all night.

01:17:36.920 --> 01:17:37.880
Yes, but...
